/Hadsel%C3%B8ya_-_Taen.jpg/960px-Hadsel%C3%B8ya_-_Taen.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hadsel%C3%B8ya_-_Taen.jpg","a":"Blue Elf","l":"CC BY-SA 3.0","t":"Taen in Hadsel, Norway, seen towards the southeast. This photo was taken by me"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Gawhar_Shad_bigum_by_ali_mosavi_sam.jpg/960px-Gawhar_Shad_bigum_by_ali_mosavi_sam.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gawhar_Shad_bigum_by_ali_mosavi_sam.jpg","a":"Alimosavisam","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"نمایی از آرامگاه گوهرشاد بیگم، هرات، افغانستان"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Gazer_Gah_-.JPG/960px-Gazer_Gah_-.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gazer_Gah_-.JPG","a":"Indiana jo","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"アフガニスタン・ヘラート郊外にあるガザルガー 2003年8月に訪問した際に撮影（フィルムスキャナーでネガをデジタル画像化）"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/1973-12-05_Herat_%289%29.jpg/960px-1973-12-05_Herat_%289%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1973-12-05_Herat_(9).jpg","a":"David","l":"CC BY-SA 2.0","t":"Market street, Herat"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/354_Cameron_road_near_Herat_-_USACE-p15141coll5-15683.jpeg/960px-354_Cameron_road_near_Herat_-_USACE-p15141coll5-15683.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:354_Cameron_road_near_Herat_-_USACE-p15141coll5-15683.jpeg","a":"Cameron, Harry F.","l":"Public domain","t":"Herat-Islam Qala road: Cassai, vicinity of Herat."},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/2009_Herat_Afghanistan_41122520